cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rekindle or build on it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rekindle"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, human-in-the-loop research assistant that connects what you read
  (articles, YouTube) to the writing projects you set aside in an Obsidian vault, using
  local embeddings and LLM-proposed actions that are written only when you accept them.
authors:
